    <!-- Key Rules Box -->
    <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES (R2):&amp;#xa;1. Live render: Tool block &amp; Container default EXPANDED (user follows progress)&amp;#xa;2. NO auto-collapse while ANY tool running/pending (streaming)&amp;#xa;3. Auto-collapse ONCE per container/block when ALL terminal + !userManaged&amp;#xa;4. User click → data-user-managed=true → AUTO RULES STOP FOREVER (this session)&amp;#xa;5. userExpanded / thinkingUser / userManaged persisted in tab.messages → survives reload&amp;#xa;6. Toolbar Collapse All → sets userManaged=true, userExpanded=false for ALL&amp;#xa;7. Toolbar Expand All → sets userManaged=true, userExpanded=true for ALL&amp;#xa;8. New cycle = new container = fresh default EXPANDED (not sticky from prev cycle)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#303F9F;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
